<div class="kb-grid kb-g3"><div class="kb-card kb-card-l"><span class="kb-num">01</span><h3 class="kb-h3">Pop-ups &amp; activations</h3><p class="kb-body">Your own pop-up, or a spot in a KOLLAB-run city stop like Seoul Social Club and Bloom Haus.</p><ul><li>Concept, venue and space design</li><li>Ticketing and RSVPs on Luma</li><li>Creator and press guest list</li><li>On-site content capture</li></ul></div><div class="kb-card kb-card-r"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px"><span class="kb-num">02</span><span class="kb-pill">Now booking</span></div><h3 class="kb-h3">Retail test in New York</h3><p class="kb-body">SUKOSHI × KOLLAB STATION puts a new K-brand on a Manhattan shelf every week this holiday season.</p><ul><li>SUKOSHI, Upper East Side · Dec 7 – Jan 31</li><li>Two-week shelf slots, a curated line-up</li><li>January slots add a featured booth week</li><li>KOLLAB-run marketing included</li></ul></div><div class="kb-card kb-card-d"><span class="kb-num">03</span><h3 class="kb-h3">Online + offline marketing</h3><p class="kb-body">Campaigns built around what your brand needs, with the event at the center.</p><ul><li>Paid creator collaborations, matched on fit</li><li>Workshops and beauty masterclasses</li><li>Short-form content for TikTok and Reels</li><li>Newsletter and social launch</li></ul></div></div>
